📱 WhatsApp Clone – Synchronus-RealTimeChatApp
A full-stack real-time chat application built with the MERN stack and Socket.io, designed to replicate core features of WhatsApp including instant messaging, contact list, and session-based authentication.

🚀 Features

🔐 Authentication & Security – Secure login/signup with JWT & cookie-based session management

💬 Real-time Messaging – Built with Socket.io for instant delivery of messages

📇 Contact Management – Dynamic contacts list with recent chats and last messages

🗄️ Efficient Data Handling – Used MongoDB aggregation pipelines for optimized queries

🎨 Modern UI – Built with Tailwind CSS + Shadcn/UI for responsive and clean design

🔔 Enhanced UX – Added Lucide-React icons, Lottie animations, and human-readable timestamps with Moment.js

⚡ State Management – API caching and data fetching with RTK Query/Axios for UploadFile,DowndloadFile, ContextApi for SocketIo


🛠️ Tech Stack

Frontend:
React.js
Tailwind CSS
Shadcn/UI / Shadcn/expansion
Lucide-React
Lottie Animations
Redux 
contextApi
Axios

Backend:
Node.js
Express.js
Socket.io
JWT Authentication

Database:
MongoDB (with Aggregation Pipelines)


⚙️ Installation & Setup


🔹 Backend Setup
cd server
npm install
nodemon server.js

🔹 Frontend Setup
cd client
npm install
npm run dev


